            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosipok ikerubin togo lokotoma: kigararaete abebenoka nuka ikerubin tetere etirorit abebenok adiopet arwatat adiopet, etirorit da abebenok naka ekerubi ece arwatat epuai; kiriamakina abebenokakec kidin togo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
