          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kokaru lokitomonet ka lodiopet, kolap Bul, ŋes elap lokikanyetekauni, kodaun etogo katutubetake kere, kwape ajaar aputoke. Kwaŋin kodau ikar ikanykaarei eduki.",
          "type": "text",
